| **C. Literature Review** | Complete literature-parity v1 architecture (A2/D2/D3/D1/E1/E3/H1/H2/X1/B2/C1+C4) + F2/F3/F4 enforcement | Shipped: `parity_validate`, `attest_parity`, Union Gate, Signal 13 | D4 (blind-as-cross-check), X2 (invariant library), higher rigor modes deferred |
| **D. Reference Content** | Claim-tier rubrics + `/using-bathos` skill sections; literature-parity workflow + skill sections; gate error taxonomy | Shipped: skill sections, rubrics, gate taxonomy (v0.10.x) | Sprint-audit signals (7) proposed but unclear if shipped; phase-specific guidance in skill |

